d peaks and segments that need closer review.","problem":"Help an energy organisation understand consumption behaviour, demand patterns, tariff performance and customer segments using smart-meter data.","outcome":"","milestones":"","skills":"Data Analytics, SQL, Python, Time Series Analysis, Segmentation, Energy Analytics, Dashboarding","commitment":"","repository":"https://github.com/Mettelo/MTL-DA-003-Energy-Demand-Tariff-Customer-Consumption-Intelligence","collaboration":"","roles":["Data Analyst","BI Developer"],"seo_title":"Energy Demand, Tariff & Customer Consumption Intelligence | Mettelo","seo_description":"An energy organisation needs to understand when customers consume energy and how demand differs across tariffs and customer groups. Build a smart-meter analysis and dashboard showing consumption patterns, demand peaks and segments that need closer review.","share_title":"Energy Demand, Tariff & Customer Consumption Intelligence","share_description":"An energy organisation needs to understand when customers consume energy and how demand differs across tariffs and customer groups. Build a smart-meter analysis and dashboard showing consumption patterns, demand peaks and segments that need closer review.","share_image":"","share_image_alt":""}},{"key":"project:MTL-DA-004","kind":"project","label":"Road Safety, Collision Risk & Transport Intelligence","data":{"title":"Road Safety, Collision Risk & Transport Intelligence","category":"Data Analytics","description":"A transport authority needs to identify recurring collision and casualty patterns so road-safety investigations can be better targeted. Build an analysis and dashboard showing where, when and under which recorded conditions serious safety concerns occur.","problem":"Help a transport authority understand when, where and under what conditions collisions and casualties occur so interventions can be better targeted.","outcome":"","milestones":"","skills":"Data Analytics, Python, SQL, Geospatial Analysis, 