Requirements & Decision Rules","share_description":"An SME lender has ambiguous application completeness, decision authority and exception handling. Develop an FRD, detailed use cases, decision tables and traceability for an assisted workflow that retains human decision ownership.","share_image":"","share_image_alt":""}},{"key":"project:MTL-BA-044","kind":"project","label":"Employee Onboarding & Access Integration Analysis","data":{"title":"Employee Onboarding & Access Integration Analysis","category":"Business Analysis","description":"HR, service tickets and identity systems do not reliably coordinate joiners, changed dates and leavers. Specify interface behaviour, data mappings, event flows and recovery controls for a bounded integration handover.","problem":"Harrowgate needs authoritative employment events, reliable identifiers and accountable failure handling; ticket closure or directory acceptance alone does not establish worker readiness or complete revocation.","outcome":"","milestones":"","skills":"Business Analysis, Interface requirements, Data mapping, Sequence diagrams, Failure recovery, Non-functional requirements","commitment":"","repository":"https://github.com/Mettelo/MTL-BA-044-Employee-Onboarding-Access-Management-Transformation","collaboration":"","roles":["Business Analyst","Technical Business Analyst"],"seo_title":"Employee Onboarding & Access Integration Analysis | Mettelo","seo_description":"HR, service tickets and identity systems do not reliably coordinate joiners, changed dates and leavers. Specify interface behaviour, data mappings, event flows and recovery controls for a bounded integration handover.","share_title":"Employee Onboarding & Access Integration Analysis","share_description":"HR, service tickets and identity systems do not reliably coordinate joiners, changed dates and leavers. Specify interface behaviour, data mappings, event flows and recovery controls for a bounded integration handover.","share_image":"","share_image_alt":""}},{"key":"project:MTL-BA-045","kind":"project","label":"CRM & Sales Pipeline Agile Product Analysis","data":{"title":"CRM & Sales Pipeline Agile Product Analysis","category":"Business Analysis","description":"A sales business has scattered lead records, unreliable forecasts and competing CRM requests. Define a coherent MVP, prioritise epics and user stories with acceptance criteria, explore interactions and recommend a feasible release.","problem":"Beaconbridge needs to choose the smallest useful capability for six sellers rather than treating every department request as mandatory first-release scope.","outcome":"","milestones":"","skills":"Business Analysis, MVP, Story mapping, User stories, Acceptance criteria, Wireframes, Backlog refinement","commitment":"","repository":"https://github.com/Mettelo/MTL-BA-045-CRM-Sales-Pipeline-Transformation","collaboration":"","roles":["Business Analyst","Agile Business Analyst"],"seo_title":"CRM & Sales Pipeline Agile Product Analysis | Mettelo","seo_description":"A sales business has scattered lead records, unreliable forecasts and competing CRM requests. Define a coherent MVP, prioritise epics and user stories with acceptance criteria, explore interactions and recommend a feasible release.","share_title":"CRM & Sales Pipeline Agile Product Analysis","share_description":"A sales business has scattered lead records, unreliable forecasts and competing CRM requests. Define a coherent MVP, prioritise epics and user stories with acceptance criteria, explore interactions and recommend a feasible release.","share_image":"","share_image_alt":""}},{"key":"project:MTL-AI-046","kind":"project","label":"Data Quality Investigation Copilot","data":{"title":"Data Quality Investigation Copilot","category":"Artificial Intelligence","description":"A data operations team receives failed validation checks but still spends significant time investigating what failed, what may be affected and what evidence to collect next. Build a local AI copilot that combines deterministic data-quality evidence with bounded AI assistance to produce evidence-linked investigation drafts, safe next steps and human-reviewed incident reports.","problem":"Validation identifies failed rules but does not reliably explain likely causes, downstream impact or the evidence an engineer should investigate next.","outcome":"","milestones":"","skills":"Artificial Intelligence, AI Engineering, Data Quality, Python, Data Validation, LLM Engineering, AI Evaluation, Guardrails, Human-in-the-Loop","commitment":"","repository":"https://github.com/Mettelo/MTL-AI-046-Data-Quality-Investigation-Copilot","collaboration":"","roles":["AI Engineer","Data Engineer","Data Quality Analyst","AI Governance / Assurance"],"seo_title":"Data Quality Investigation Copilot | Mettelo","seo_description":"A data operations team receives failed validation checks but still spends significant time investigating what failed, what may be affected and what evidence to collect next. Build a local AI copilot that combines deterministic data-quality evidence with bounded AI assistance to produce evidence-link","share_title":"Data Quality Investigation Copilot","share_description":"A data operations team receives failed validation checks but still spends significant time investigating what failed, what may be affected and what evidence to collect next. Build a local AI copilot that combines deterministic data-quality evidence with bounded AI assistance to produce evidence-linked investigation drafts, safe next steps and human-reviewed incident reports.","share_image":"","share_image_alt":""}},{"key":"project:MTL-AI-047","kind":"project","label":"Mobility Operations Narrative Copilot","data":{"title":"Mobility Operations Narrative Copilot","category":"Artificial Intelligence","description":"A mobility operations team can calculate rental KPIs but still prepares management briefings manually. Build a local AI product in which Python or SQL computes every metric first, then the model explains only verified movements, contributing factors, limitations and investigation questions through evidence-linked narratives.","problem":"Management reporting is slow and inconsistent, while allowing an LLM to calculate or improvise metrics would create unacceptable factual risk.","outcome":"","milestones":"","skills":"Artificial Intelligence, AI Engineering, Analytics Engineering, Python, KPI Design, LLM Engineering, Claim Verification, AI Evaluation, Decision Support","commitment":"","repository":"https://github.com/Mettelo/MTL-AI-047-Mobility-Operations-Narrative-Copilot","collaboration":"","roles":["AI Engineer","Data Analyst","Analytics Engineer","AI Governance / Assurance"],"seo_title":"Mobility Operations Narrative Copilot | Mettelo","seo_description":"A mobility operations team can calculate rental KPIs but still prepares management briefings manually. Build a local AI product in which Python or SQL computes every metric first, then the model explains only verified movements, contributing factors, limitations and investigation questions through e","share_title":"Mobility Operations Narrative Copilot","share_description":"A mobility operations team can calculate rental KPIs but still prepares management briefings manually. Build a local AI product in which Python or SQL computes every metric first, then the model explains only verified movements, contributing factors, limitations and investigation questions through evidence-linked narratives.","share_image":"","share_image_alt":""}},{"key":"project:MTL-AI-048","kind":"project","label":"Meeting Decision & Action Copilot","data":{"title":"Meeting Decision & Action Copilot","category":"Artificial Intelligence","description":"Project teams often leave meetings with inconsistent interpretations of decisions, commitments and unresolved questions. Build a local assistant that converts approved transcripts into evidence-linked decision, action and question candidates, preserves explicitly stated owners and deadlines, and requires human review before exporting minutes and an action register.","problem":"Manual meeting records are slow to prepare and often lose ownership, deadlines, reversals and the transcript evidence supporting each decision or action.","outcome":"","milestones":"","skills":"Artificial Intelligence, AI Engineering, NLP, LLM Engineering, Information Extraction, Evidence Grounding, Human-in-the-Loop, AI Evaluation","commitment":"","repository":"https://github.com/Mettelo/MTL-AI-048-Meeting-Decision-Action-Copilot","collaboration":"","roles":["AI Engineer","NLP / Data Engineer","Product / Business Analyst","AI Governance / Assurance"],"seo_title":"Meeting Decision & Action Copilot | Mettelo","seo_description":"Project teams often leave meetings with inconsistent interpretations of decisions, commitments and unresolved questions. Build a local assistant that converts approved transcripts into evidence-linked decision, action and question candidates, preserves explicitly stated owners and deadlines, and req","share_title":"Meeting Decision & Action Copilot","share_description":"Project teams often leave meetings with inconsistent interpretations of decisions, commitments and unresolved questions. Build a local assistant that converts approved transcripts into evidence-linked decision, action and question candidates, preserves explicitly stated owners and deadlines, and requires human review before exporting minutes and an action register.","share_image":"","share_image_alt":""}},{"key":"project:MTL-AI-049","kind":"project","label":"SOC Incident Investigation Copilot","data":{"title":"SOC Incident Investigation Copilot","category":"Artificial Intelligence","description":"SOC analysts receive fragmented alerts and event records that need to be reconstructed into a defensible incident narrative. Build a local copilot that validates and orders telemetry, correlates related entities, proposes evidence-supported MITRE ATT&CK mappings, surfaces unknowns and produces a human-reviewed incident handover.","problem":"Alert severity alone does not establish chronology, entity relationships, supported ATT&CK behaviour, evidence gaps or the next investigation step.","outcome":"","milestones":"","skills":"Artificial Intelligence, AI Engineering, Cybersecurity, Security Operations, MITRE ATT&CK, Event Correlation, LLM Engineering, AI Evaluation, Security Assurance","commitment":"","repository":"https://github.com/Mettelo/MTL-AI-049-SOC-Incident-Investigation-Copilot","collaboration":"","roles":["AI Engineer","SOC Analyst","Security Data Engineer","Threat / Detection Analyst","Security Assurance Analyst"],"seo_title":"SOC Incident Investigation Copilot | Mettelo","seo_description":"SOC analysts receive fragmented alerts and event records that need to be reconstructed into a defensible incident narrative. Build a local copilot that validates and orders telemetry, correlates related entities, proposes evidence-supported MITRE ATT&CK mappings, surfaces unknowns and produces a hum","share_title":"SOC Incident Investigation Copilot","share_description":"SOC analysts receive fragmented alerts and event records that need to be reconstructed into a defensible incident narrative. Build a local copilot that validates and orders telemetry, correlates related entities, proposes evidence-supported MITRE ATT&CK mappings, surfaces unknowns and produces a human-reviewed incident handover.","share_image":"","share_image_alt":""}},{"key":"project:MTL-AI-050","kind":"project","label":"Cybersecurity Framework Change Intelligence Assistant","data":{"title":"Cybersecurity Framework Change Intelligence Assistant","category":"Artificial Intelligence","description":"Cybersecurity governance teams migrating from NIST CSF 1.1 to 2.0 need more than a textual diff. Build a local assistant that preserves NIST crosswalk relationships, identifies structural and wording changes, drafts evidence-linked organisational impact hypotheses, blocks unsupported obligations and produces a human-reviewed change register.","problem":"Manual framework comparison is slow and can confuse renumbering, moved outcomes, split/merge relationships and wording changes with substantive compliance requirements.","outcome":"","milestones":"","skills":"Artificial Intelligence, AI Engineering, Cybersecurity Governance, Document Intelligence, NIST CSF, LLM Engineering, Change Detection, AI Evaluation, Governance","commitment":"","repository":"https://github.com/Mettelo/MTL-AI-050-Cybersecurity-Framework-Change-Intelligence-Assistant","collaboration":"","roles":["AI Engineer","Cybersecurity Governance Analyst","Data / Document Engineer","Risk / Control Analyst","AI Governance / Assurance"],"seo_title":"Cybersecurity Framework Change Intelligence Assistant | Mettelo","seo_description":"Cybersecurity governance teams migrating from NIST CSF 1.1 to 2.0 need more than a textual diff. Build a local assistant that preserves NIST crosswalk relationships, identifies structural and wording changes, drafts evidence-linked organisational impact hypotheses, blocks unsupported obligations and","share_title":"Cybersecurity Framework Change Intelligence Assistant","share_description":"Cybersecurity governance teams migrating from NIST CSF 1.1 to 2.0 need more than a textual diff. Build a local assistant that preserves NIST crosswalk relationships, identifies structural and wording changes, drafts evidence-linked organisational impact hypotheses, blocks unsupported obligations and produces a human-reviewed change register.","share_image":"","share_image_alt":""}},{"key":"page:home","kind":"home","label":"Homepage","data":{"seo_title":"Mettelo | Data, AI & Technology Community","seo_description":"Connect with Data, AI and Technology professionals, contribute to practical projects and learn together. Mettelo is free to join.","share_title":"Mettelo | Data, AI & Technology Community","share_description":"Connect with Data, AI and Technology professionals, contribute to practical projects and learn together. Mettelo is free to join.","share_image":"https://mettelo.com/assets/community-collaboration-1200.webp","share_image_alt":"Professionals collaborating around laptops on a shared project","headline":"Put your skills to work.\nBuild with people in your field.","intro":"Turn what you know into work you can show. Take on practical challenges, meet people who share your ambition and build your next chapter. Free to join.","primary_label":"Find your next step","primary_href":"/signup","secondary_label":"Explore projects","secondary_href":"/projects/","faqs":[{"question":"How do I get started?","answer":"Create an account and confirm your email. Explore Mettelo Connect, learning resources or project briefs. You only need to reach 80% saved profile completion when you want to apply to a project."},{"question":"Do I need a Lab to join the community?","answer":"No. Mettelo Connect brings together updates, questions, project ideas and collaboration posts. You can follow people and discover opportunities without a Lab. Participation does not guarantee employment or payment."},{"question":"Who can see my profile?","answer":"Members see the details you choose to share. Control visibility and message requests in My profile. Hidden and blocked profiles stay unavailable; education, experience and private account details are not published automatically."},{"question":"How do I apply and enter a Lab?","answer":"Read a brief, confirm your email and save at least 80% of your profile. Apply with a supported working preference and describe your contribution. Mettelo Lab shows the decision and any preparation steps. Legacy offers still need a response; approval alone does not open a Lab."},{"question":"How many Labs can I join?","answer":"The current standard allowance is three. Official placements and Connect collaborations share it. Paused Labs, accepted places in preparation and unexpired official offers hold slots. Completed Labs and fully exited memberships do not. Leaving releases a slot after access revocation completes."},{"question":"What goes into My Portfolio?","answer":"Your contributions, evidenced milestone acceptances, practised skills and confirmed team delivery outcomes. Member-reported work is distinct from reviewed outcomes; neither is an independently verified qualification. Your portfolio stays private unless you explicitly share a selected summary."},{"question":"How do jobs and learning resources work?","answer":"Explore the Job Board and apply on the employer’s source website. Use the recorded workshops and member Resources to prepare. Check each advert’s deadline, eligibility and sponsorship details."},{"question":"How do I get help?","answer":"Use My enquiries for private account, application or Lab support, and follow replies there. Or use Contact & Support without an account. Never send passwords, access keys or confidential project data."},{"question":"Can an organisation partner with Mettelo?","answer":"Yes. Use the partnership enquiry form to discuss a project challenge, workshop, mentoring or other collaboration. Explain the organisation, proposed contribution and intended benefit. Enquiring does not create a partnership or project commitment."}],"ecosystem":[{"title":"Mettelo Community","description":"Meet people in your field, exchange practical knowledge and find collaborators."},{"title":"Mettelo Labs","description":"Explore a brief and apply to contribute. Selected members build with their teams in the Lab."},{"title":"Mettelo Talent","description":"Prepare your applications and explore externally advertised roles relevant to your skills."},{"title":"Mettelo Proof","description":"Evidence of contribution and demonstrated capability."},{"title":"Mettelo Research","description":"Practical insight into Data, AI and Technology work."},{"title":"Mettelo AI","description":"Tools to support professional work and development."},{"title":"Mettelo Summit","description":"Events and showcases connecting people and ideas."}]}},{"key":"page:about","kind":"about","label":"About Us","data":{"seo_title":"About Mettelo | Connect, Learn, Build & Grow","seo_description":"Discover Mettelo: an infrastructure for Data, AI and Technology professionals to connect with people in their field, learn, build and grow.","share_title":"About Mettelo | Connect, Learn, Build & Grow","share_description":"Discover Mettelo: an infrastructure for Data, AI and Technology professionals to connect with people in their field, learn, build and grow.","share_image":"https://mettelo.com/assets/community-collaboration-1200.webp","share_image_alt":"Professionals collaborating around laptops on a shared project","headline":"Connecting what you know\nwith what comes next.","intro":"Mettelo is an infrastructure for Data, AI and Technology professionals to connect, learn, build and grow.","support":"Find people in your field. Put knowledge into practice. Make your contribution visible.","story":"Knowing a tool is one step. Having somewhere to use it—and people to work through it with—is another.","mission":"The value comes from how people learn, work and contribute together.","founder_name":"O. Johnson Taiwo","founder_role":"Founder, Mettelo","founder_quote":"I believe professional growth should go beyond qualifications and certifications. People need opportunities to apply their knowledge, collaborate, solve real problems and demonstrate what they can do.","founder_image":"/assets/founder-960.jpg","founder_image_alt":"O. Johnson Taiwo, founder of Mettelo","hero_image":"/assets/community-collaboration-1200.webp","hero_image_alt":"Professionals collaborating around laptops and project notes in a shared workspace","founder_linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ojtaiwo/","founder_website":"https://johnsontaiwo.com/"}},{"key":"brand:defaults","kind":"brand","label":"Brand defaults","data":{"organisation_name":"Mettelo","organisation_description":"An infrastructure for Data, AI and Technology professionals to learn, build and grow.","tagline":"Where contribution becomes opportunity.","share_image":"/assets/community-collaboration-1200.webp","share_image_alt":"Professionals collaborating around laptops on a shared project","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/officialmettelohq/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/officialmettelo/","website":"https://mettelo.com"}}]$seed$::jsonb)x;
